    "body": "- [ ] I, the PR author, have personally reviewed every line of this PR.\n\n# What does this PR do?\n\nA fresh run with `--split-sentences --partitions 1` currently exits successfully after producing the `_ss.jsonl` intermediate. The `continue` bypasses encoding, so neither the requested `.bin` nor `.idx` exists until a second invocation. Remove that early continuation so the first invocation splits and tokenizes.\n\nThis is an AI-assisted draft. Human author review and NVIDIA GPU/CI validation are pending.\n\n## Issue tracking\n\nLinked issue: none; this is a narrowly scoped reproduced bug fix.\n\n## Validation\n\nThe actual CLI baseline exited 0 with only the input and split intermediate. The added first-invocation regression failed before the patch and passes after it; it reads the actual IndexedDataset and verifies tokens and document boundaries. Its deterministic local fixture uses real NLTK-generated Punkt resources and the production entrypoint through runpy; only the nltk.download network boundary is intercepted. The production encoder, tokenizer, sentence splitter, and dataset builder run unchanged.\n\n- Focused CPU validation: **1 passed** using actual production imports and generated fixtures; no production modules or functions are replaced by stubs.\n- Command: `/opt/cpu-review/bin/python -m pytest --confcutdir=tests/unit_tests/data tests/unit_tests/data/test_single_sentence_split.py -q`.\n- CPU environment: Linux container, Python 3.12, PyTorch 2.8 CPU, real Triton package for imports. `--confcutdir` excludes the parent suite's unrelated GPU/data fixtures; this is not the canonical NVIDIA development image or full distributed test run.\n- Repository `BASE_REF=main CHECK_ONLY=true SKIP_DOCS=false bash tools/autoformat.sh` completed successfully: Black, isort, Pylint and Ruff blocking checks passed.\n- The formatter's informational mypy step reports that NLTK has no typing stubs; its configured blocking checks pass.\n\n## Contribution process\n\n- [x] I have added relevant unit tests\n- [ ] I have added relevant functional tests\n- [ ] I have added proper typing to my code\n- [ ] I have added relevant documentation\n- [x] I have run the repository autoformatter\n\nNo GPU kernel is added or modified.\n",
